  "name": "US Telehealth Couples Fertility Diagnostics (AMH, Semen Analysis) & Oral Ovulation Induction (Letrozole, Clomid) Cost Dataset \u2014 November 2026",
  "description": "Normalized 64-row multi-config dataset across 20 US telehealth fertility platforms, diagnostic laboratories, and brick-and-mortar REI clinics auditing self-pay prices for Couples Fertility Diagnostics (36 rows: AMH, Day-3 Hormone Panels, Pelvic Ultrasound, CLIA Semen Analysis) and Oral Ovulation Induction Cycles (28 rows: Letrozole, Clomiphene Citrate, Timed Intercourse vs. IUI/IVF Benchmarks) as of November 10, 2026.",
  "url": "https://getskinnyonline.com/datasets/telehealth-fertility-diagnostics-treatment-pricing-2026/",
  "sameAs": [
    "https://huggingface.co/datasets/get-skinny-online/telehealth-fertility-diagnostics-treatment-pricing-2026",
    "https://getskinnyonline.com/blog/2026-online-fertility-testing-letrozole-clomid-cost-report",
    "https://getskinnyonline.com/fertility",
    "https://getskinnyonline.com/fertility/fertility-medication",
    "https://getskinnyonline.com/fertility/letrozole-vs-clomid",
    "https://getskinnyonline.com/datasets/telehealth-fertility-diagnostics-treatment-pricing-2026/",
    "https://github.com/jcburrows-alt/telehealth-fertility-diagnostics-treatment-pricing-2026"
  ],
  "version": "2026.11.1",
  "datePublished": "2026-11-10",
  "dateModified": "2026-11-10",
  "license": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/",
  "isAccessibleForFree": true,
  "citeAs": "Get Skinny Online Health Economics Research Group (2026). US Telehealth Couples Fertility Diagnostics & Oral Ovulation Induction Cost Dataset \u2014 November 2026 (v2026.11.1). https://getskinnyonline.com/datasets/telehealth-fertility-diagnostics-treatment-pricing-2026/",
